A sigil fence takes its attribute line

```
{#poem .verse}
::: |
Roses are red,
  Violets are blue.
:::
.
<div id="poem" class="verse line-block">
  <p>Roses are red,<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;Violets are blue.</p>
</div>
```

```
{#poem}
::: |
one
two
:::
.
<div id="poem" class="line-block">
  <p>one<br>
two</p>
</div>
```

```
{#addr .contact}
::: \
one
two
:::
.
<div id="addr" class="contact hardbreaks">
  <p>one<br>
two</p>
</div>
```
